f you don't want your kid to  wear a mask and those mass mandates are  lifted shouldn't be judged at all as we  heard from dr jaw one way masking is  effective if you're particularly  vulnerable or particularly concerned you  can wear a mask and provide protection  to yourself and others can make their  own decisions right i think that that is  the future particularly the school  setting yeah  all right thank you for that nora

